  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMS-Current affairs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to strengthen the rights of minority faith and belief groups and fight discrimination based on faith and belief in the MENA region. A new concept of &quot;Current Affairs&quot; will be developed, which will target young Arab viewers. The program will be more strategic, with more impactful and evidence-based programming.</narrative>
  </description>
